# ── Rust gateway build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
/gateway/target/
**/target/
*.pdb

# ── Python executor / downloader caches ───────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ── Internal working docs (NOT shipped) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Session scratch / analysis / research — underscore-prefixed by convention.
docs/_*.md
docs/_*.json
notes/*.md

# Root-level dev review / audit reports — analysis INPUTS (the consumer-seat
# review, red-team, production-readiness audit). Kept on disk for reference;
# never shipped in the public package.
/houdini-mcp-agent-review.md
/*-review.md
/*-audit.md
/*_REVIEW.md
/*_AUDIT.md

# ── Draft docs staged for review (promoted deliberately, never auto-committed) ─
README.NEW.md
*.draft.md

# ── Runtime / local config & secrets (live in the user profile, never the repo)─
arm.json
*.token
*.secret

# ── Executor / gateway run logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────
houdini-mcp_*.log
*.log

# ── Session probe / experiment toolset — local only, NEVER shipped ────────────
# Kept on disk as a reusable hython probe kit; excluded because prior-session
# scripts here may carry local working paths that must not reach the repo.
/scratchpad/

# ── Transient third-party source we clone to work with, then delete ───────────
# (kept out in case a clone ever lands under the tree; canonical location is C:\dev\)
/RadeonProRenderUSD*/
/third_party/
/_scratch/

# ── AMD ProRender prebuilt binaries — ship as a GitHub Release asset, NEVER in git ─
# (source, patches, attribution + the pack script DO ship; only the built payload is out)
/AMDProRender/dist/out/

# ── Houdini working files that may appear during live testing ─────────────────
*.hip
*.hipnc
*.hiplc
backup/
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.orig

# ── Stray dev-test scratch (never ship) ───────────────────────────────────────
/e2e_err.txt
/geo/

# ── Raw node-probe dumps — dev build-inputs that generated reference/houdini_nodes.json ─
# (the generated runtime reference/*.json + NODE_REFERENCE.md DO ship; the raw probes don't)
/reference/probes/

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# local Claude Code config (never ship)
.claude/
